      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m curious as to why you want to break this out into it\u0027s own object? Are you using the \u0027APIs\u0027 class anywhere else?",
      "revId": "c0967193c679b2dacbc0b94245d43f7882d4e5b2",
